                        "sense_id": "f5a38c08-542b-3d3f-be3b-cec9dfccac6c",
                        "entry_id": "667a53f7-c62d-3592-a1c1-aa6f5b2bb751",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to mumble"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb92e062-9a5d-4e61-adf2-83bfb30c266a",
                                "sense_id": "f5a38c08-542b-3d3f-be3b-cec9dfccac6c",
                                "text": "На э́тот раз па́рень был не оди́н, а с каки́м-то то́щим, о́чень бле́дным старико́м, кото́рый, не перестава́я, кива́л голово́й, как ма́ятником, и ша́мкал губа́ми.",
                                "translation": "This time the young peasant was not alone, but with a gaunt, very pale old man who nodded his head without ceasing, like a pendulum, and mumbled with his lips.",
                                "english": "This time the young peasant was not alone, but with a gaunt, very pale old man who nodded his head without ceasing, like a pendulum, and mumbled with his lips."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
